WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.315
Clone the Kettle sample app,

2
00:00:02.365 --> 00:00:06.979
a small coffee-order app with three screens and two components.

3
00:00:07.029 --> 00:00:12.102
Build it with the Gradle wrapper and install it on a running emulator,

4
00:00:12.152 --> 00:00:14.139
then start it with adb.

5
00:00:14.189 --> 00:00:18.984
Kettle opens on its Menu screen, which is what Scry will capture.

